Replicated domcon architecture for Rieltorie:
- packages/render — isomorphic React components (PropertyCard, ObjectPage, Visitka, etc.)
- apps/site — static site generator (tsx build → dist/)
- apps/miniapp — Telegram Mini App with live preview and photo compression
- worker — stateless Cloudflare Worker (HMAC verify → atomic GitHub commit)
- content — realtor YAML, theme JSON, example object
- schema — TypeScript types + JSON schemas
- .github/workflows/build.yml — CI/CD to GitHub Pages
- SETUP.md — full deployment instructions

